@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine

[*] --> Off

state Activated
Activated : entry / Set alarm time
Activated : do / Ringing alarm

state On
On : entry / Turn off activated alarm
On : do / Stop ringing alarm

Off --> Activated : set alarm time
Activated --> On : turn off alarm
Activated --> Activated : current time matches set alarm time

On --> Activated : stop alarm
Activated --> Off : next scheduled alarm time

@enduml
